id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42558::$$$message_0341_0000_0000$$$::"Found you, Shirou![humming]"::
42559::$$$message_0341_0000_0001$$$::"Hm? What a coincidence, Illya. [wait canskip=0 time=400][l][hffacechg chara=士郎 face=哀 time=200][say storage=HSHI3_SHI_0020 _name=士郎]Wow, Berserker's with you. We aren't supposed to fight in broad daylight, you know."::
42560::$$$message_0341_0000_0002$$$::"..."::
42561::$$$message_0341_0000_0003$$$::"It's okay, Shirou. I don't need to kill the other Masters anymore."::
42562::$$$message_0341_0000_0004$$$::"R-right. Then why's he with you?"::
42563::$$$message_0341_0000_0005$$$::"To capture you."::
42564::$$$message_0341_0000_0006$$$::"Huh, to capture me... [wait canskip=0 time=400][l][hffacechg chara=士郎 face=哀 time=200][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSHI3_SHI_0060 _name=士郎]Wait..."::
42565::$$$message_0341_0000_0007$$$::"What is the meaning of this, Illyasviel?"::
42566::$$$message_0341_0000_0008$$$::"Hehehe. I'm going to take Shirou to the Valhalla Onsen."::
42567::$$$message_0341_0000_0009$$$::"That, uh, onsen name sounds awfully close to heaven."::
42568::$$$message_0341_0000_0010$$$::"Yeah. It felt so good when I brought Taiga last time that it turned into a whole crisis."::
42569::$$$message_0341_0000_0011$$$::"Why does Shirou have to go with you?"::
42570::$$$message_0341_0000_0012$$$::"Because I want him to, of course."::
42571::$$$message_0341_0000_0013$$$::"Illyasviel, Shirou is not your possession. We already have a reservation today, so come back another time."::
42572::$$$message_0341_0000_0014$$$::"I figured you'd try to stop me, Saber."::
42573::$$$message_0341_0000_0015$$$::"...Illya, wait. Did you bring Berserker to..."::
42574::$$$message_0341_0000_0016$$$::"To deal with Saber when she tries to stop me. I can do whatever I want to you once she's not around."::
42575::$$$message_0341_0000_0017$$$::"No, but... Okay, I would be pretty helpless on my own."::
42576::$$$message_0341_0000_0018$$$::"Here they come, Shirou!"::
42577::$$$message_0341_0000_0019$$$::"Go, Berserker."::
42578::$$$message_0341_0000_0020$$$::"[wacky len=5][line len=3]!!!"~�(H